### Problem Description

I'm developing an app that includes real-time Speech-to-Text functionality using the SpeechRecognition API to capture audio. However, when running the app inside the Electron environment, I get a network error—even though I'm connected to Wi-Fi. Interestingly, the same JavaScript code works perfectly when run in Google Chrome outside of Electron.

